# Everything here is sent to the Docker daemon on every build, so keep out
# what no image ever copies. The results directory matters most: it grows a
# JSON file per benchmark run, and without this every run would make the next
# build slower.
.git/
.gitattributes
.gitignore
.claude/
benchmarks/results/
vendor/
.env
*.md

# Anchored to the repository root on purpose: docker/roadrunner/composer.lock
# is what makes that image's dependency set reproducible and MUST reach the
# build context. An unanchored "composer.lock" would quietly exclude it.
/composer.lock
